  {
   "id": "bad-end-theater-178264@patch-2021-11-06",
   "gameId": "bad-end-theater-178264",
   "displayName": "Balance Patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-11-06T19:42:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "hi, everyone! first of all, thanks so much for playing BAD END THEATER!! the response has been way bigger than expected--i'm so happy my game is making such an impact on people <3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "i had to do a couple hotfixes within the first couple days of release, but there doesn't seem to have been any major bugs (thank goodness!). there was one bit of feedback i felt i had to address though, thus the balance patch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "**SPOILERS AHEAD!!**",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "v1.0.5 updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "TRAGEDY now does 5 damage to start (instead of 1), decreasing with each party member you summon. wrong answers will increase TRAGEDY's damage by 1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "a shortcut for total reset has been added to the game menu (appears after you've gone through the resetting process at least once)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "music gallery is no longer locked after total reset",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "minor art fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "typo fixes for korean and chinese translations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "thanks again for playing BAD END THEATER! i hope to add more languages in the next update :) stay tuned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-nami",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
